# Thought Invoker — one of the Henchmen of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 10/12 The Henchmen — up to 27 life, can't be bribed
# enemy: Thought Invoker (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0232.dck "Thought Invoker (Ub, 4th)" [Tier 3 —
#   Manalink 3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 13 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 10
#   lines (60 cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/thought_invoker.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level
#   10) [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/thought_invoker.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Henchmen) — "The Thought Invoker"
#   (Original) [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Thought Invoker
22 Island
